      "_rawMarkdown": "# Markdown test note\n\nEdit this note to test markdown authoring. It is a real file at\n`content/boards/test-board/notes.md`.\n\n## Caret check line\n\nClick mid-word after the underscore: **bold**, an _underscore_ word, and a snake_case word. The\ncaret should land exactly where you clicked.\n\n## Lists\n\n- one item\n- another with `inline code`\n- a [link](https://example.com)\n",
